<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In LLMs Don’t Know Their Own Decision Boundaries:The Unreliability of Self-Generated Counterfactual Explanations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Related work</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
